# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# LLM configuration — a fallback CHAIN, tried in order for every generation.
#
# Auto-detected default order (only providers whose key is set are used):
#   Gemini  ->  OpenRouter (free)  ->  Vercel AI Gateway  ->  Anthropic  ->  OpenAI  ->  mock
#
# If a model errors (bad key, rate limit, unsupported output), the next one in
# the chain is tried; if all fail, a deterministic offline "mock" is used so the
# app always works. The active chain is shown in the app header.
#
# Recommended setup for this project: Gemini as primary + a free OpenRouter
# model as automatic backup.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

# --- Primary: Google Gemini -------------------------------------------------
# Get a key at https://aistudio.google.com/apikey  (free tier available)
# NOTE: the free tier allows only ~20 requests per day PER MODEL. One lesson run
# costs roughly 6 (plan + questions + summary) before any tutor chat, so switch
# GEMINI_MODEL or lean on the OpenRouter backup below if you run out mid-demo.
GEMINI_API_KEY=
# GEMINI_MODEL=gemini-3.6-flash          # optional override

# --- Backup: OpenRouter (free models) ---------------------------------------
# Get a key at https://openrouter.ai/keys
# Browse free models at https://openrouter.ai/collections/free-models
OPENROUTER_API_KEY=
# OPENROUTER_MODEL=nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free   # optional override
# Free slugs get retired without warning. If the backup starts 404-ing, pick a
# current one from the link above, or use OPENROUTER_MODEL=openrouter/free to let
# OpenRouter route across whatever is free that day.

# --- Backup: Vercel AI Gateway ----------------------------------------------
# One key, ~375 models behind an OpenAI-compatible endpoint, and it is injected
# automatically on Vercel deployments. Get a key at https://vercel.com/ai-gateway
AI_GATEWAY_API_KEY=
# AI_GATEWAY_MODEL=inclusionai/ling-3.0-flash-vl   # optional override; "vendor/model"
# Browse available slugs (public, no auth): https://ai-gateway.vercel.sh/v1/models
# That list includes zero-priced models (input=0 output=0) such as
# inclusionai/ling-3.0-flash-fin and inclusionai/ling-3.0-flash-vl-free. NOTE the
# gateway refuses every request, free models included, until the Vercel account
# has a card on file ("AI Gateway requires a valid credit card on file"). It
# fails in well under a second, so an unfunded gateway costs the chain nothing.

# --- Optional additional providers ------------------------------------------
ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=
OPENAI_API_KEY=
# ANTHROPIC_MODEL=claude-sonnet-5
# OPENAI_MODEL=gpt-4o

# --- Advanced: pin the chain explicitly (otherwise auto-detected) -----------
# LLM_PROVIDER selects a single primary: gemini | openrouter | vercel | anthropic | openai | mock
# LLM_FALLBACK_PROVIDER selects one backup (only used when LLM_PROVIDER is set).
# LLM_PROVIDER=gemini
# LLM_FALLBACK_PROVIDER=openrouter
